    "title": "Two-Dimensional Range Sum Query",
    "category": "Prefix Sum",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 M matrix and multiple queries, each specifying two opposite corners of a rectangle, determine the sum of all elements inside each rectangle.",
